.Dd 2026-05-30
.Dt NOMAD-MODELS 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm nomad-models
.Nd list or pull Ollama models
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm nomad models
.Op Cm list
.Nm nomad models
.Cm pull
.Op Ar tier | Ar name ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
manages models on the native Ollama daemon, which must be responding on
.Pa http://127.0.0.1:11434 .
.Pp
With no subcommand,
.Nm
runs
.Cm list .
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Cm list
List installed models.
For each model it reports file size, the RAM estimated to run it, and a
fit verdict for this Mac's memory.
It also prints the size tiers and which tier was auto-detected for this Mac.
.It Cm pull Op Ar tier | Ar name ...
Pull models.
A single tier name pulls that tier's model set.
One or more model names pulls those exact models.
With no argument it pulls the tier resolved at dispatch
.Pq from Fl -tier or auto-detection .
The Mac is kept awake for the duration, since large pulls can run a long time.
.El
.Pp
The tier sets scale with this Mac's RAM.
The available tiers, smallest to largest, are
.Cm tiny ,
.Cm small ,
.Cm medium ,
.Cm large ,
.Cm xl ,
and
.Cm dreamy .
.Cm list
shows the approximate size and member models of each, and which one was
auto-detected for this machine.
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Ic nomad models
List installed models with fit verdicts and the tier table.
.It Ic nomad models pull medium
Pull the medium tier's model set.
.It Ic nomad models pull qwen3:32b deepseek-r1:32b
Pull those two specific models.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr nomad 1 ,
.Xr nomad-reset-ollama 1 ,
.Xr nomad-upgrade-models 1
